# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions for the latest version of Sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD)"
msgstr "Instruções de instalação da versão mais recente da diagonalização quântica baseada em amostras (SQD)"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions"
msgstr "Instruções de instalação"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions {#installation-instructions}"
msgstr "Instruções de instalação {#installation-instructions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To install, first create a new Python environment:\n"
msgstr "Para instalar, primeiro crie um novo ambiente Python:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Pré-requisitos {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it. We recommend using [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html).\n"
msgstr "Crie um ambiente mínimo com apenas o Python instalado. Recomendamos usar [ambientes virtuais Python](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "Ative seu novo ambiente.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "On Windows, run `\\path\\to\\virtual\\environment\\Scripts\\activate` instead.\n"
msgstr "No Windows, execute `\\path\\to\\virtual\\environment\\Scripts\\activate`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two primary ways to install this package – from PyPI or source. The preferred method is to install from PyPI:\n"
msgstr "Há duas formas principais de instalar este pacote: pelo PyPI ou pelo código-fonte. O método preferido é instalar pelo PyPI:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from PyPI {#install-from-pypi}"
msgstr "Instalar pelo PyPI {#install-from-pypi}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The optional `sbd` and `fulqrum` extras, and the `notebook-dependencies` extra that includes them, are supported only on Linux and macOS.\n"
msgstr "Os extras opcionais `sbd` e `fulqrum`, e o extra `notebook-dependencies` que os inclui, são suportados apenas no Linux e no macOS.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from source {#install-from-source}"
msgstr "Instalar pelo código-fonte {#install-from-source}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from source if you wish to develop in the repository or run the notebooks locally.\n"
msgstr "Instale pelo código-fonte se quiser desenvolver no repositório ou executar os notebooks localmente.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The first step is to clone the `qiskit-addon-sqd` repository.\n"
msgstr "O primeiro passo é clonar o repositório `qiskit-addon-sqd`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, upgrade pip and enter the repository.\n"
msgstr "Em seguida, atualize o pip e entre no repositório.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The next step is to install `qiskit-addon-sqd` to the virtual environment. If you plan on running the notebooks, install the notebook dependencies in order to run all the visualizations in the notebooks. Install the `dev` dependencies if you plan on developing in the repository.\n"
msgstr "O próximo passo é instalar o `qiskit-addon-sqd` no ambiente virtual. Se você pretende executar os notebooks, instale as dependências dos notebooks para poder executar todas as visualizações neles. Instale as dependências `dev` se pretende desenvolver no repositório.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust the options below to suit your needs.\n"
msgstr "Ajuste as opções abaixo conforme suas necessidades.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you installed the notebook dependencies, you can get started by running the notebooks in the docs.\n"
msgstr "Se você instalou as dependências dos notebooks, pode começar executando os notebooks da documentação.\n"
